@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Sign in as the branch manager
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@vinaybank.test", "password": "Demo@1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### KPI overview (aggregation pipelines) with risk engine health
GET {{api}}/staff/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Maker-checker queue
GET {{api}}/approvals?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer search (prefix match, KYC filter)
GET {{api}}/staff/customers?search=pri&kycStatus=VERIFIED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transactions with risk filters (staff see all)
GET {{api}}/transactions?riskLevel=HIGH&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit trail: verify the SHA-256 hash chain
GET {{api}}/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### General ledger: trial balance (SQL GROUP BY)
GET {{api}}/ledger/trial-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### General ledger: reconciliation against MongoDB balances
GET {{api}}/ledger/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Java risk engine: circuit breaker state and health
GET {{api}}/risk/engine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Run the NEFT settlement batch now
POST {{api}}/transactions/settlement/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
